          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "কৃতী — kritī — \"accomplished; high-achieving\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "আমাদের গ্রামের এক কৃতী ছাত্রী বৃত্তি পেল। Āmāder grāmer ek kritī chhātrī britti pelô. An accomplished student from our village won a scholarship."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "কৃতী (kritī) is Sanskrit kṛtin, \"one who acts\", and so \"skilful, successful\" (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
